WEBVTT

00:03:28.621 --> 00:03:30.748
I decided to focus on audio

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:35.544
because it's so immersive
and so evocative and so personal.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.922
Here's what I mean.

00:03:37.964 --> 00:03:41.842
Feel free to close your eyes
and consider where these sounds take you.

00:03:42.927 --> 00:03:44.178
(Birds chirping)

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.888
(Water flowing)

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.485
OK. Open your eyes.

00:03:59.485 --> 00:04:02.071
Were those not the sounds
you were imagining I'd play?